{
  "meta": {
    "name": "hotter-ai video workflow contracts",
    "version": "1",
    "status": "DRAFT",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-16",
    "rules": [
      "每个 workflowCode 对应后端受控目录下的一份 ComfyUI API Format JSON 模板",
      "任务提交时后端深拷贝模板，仅覆写 mapping 白名单内的节点输入键",
      "Three MiniMax H3 API templates have verified node IDs and checksums; runtime dependencies and task API remain untested (DRAFT)",
      "同一 workflowCode 的固定后台参数变化必须递增 version，禁止原地修改 PUBLISHED 版本",
      "前端仅可见 workflowCode/模型编码/字段白名单/计费展示（见 frontend/src/views/video/modules.ts）"
    ]
  },
